{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act15side_level_act15side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act15side",
  "stageId": "act15side_05",
  "title": "貨與人",
  "storyCode": "IW-5",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b47e7f389f5543b2f9c5c151f462db03605248ec3b653a837131060ae0afe95c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "5上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g05_mountaincity_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "山上的風，總是清爽的。\n一個清爽的早晨，總是適合解決一些不清不楚的事情。\n山間小鎮剛起炊煙，春雪未散，一老一小，相顧無言。\n只聽遠方一聲擊鑼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等你很久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嘁，這傢伙......阿燈，先不要輕舉妄動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我見過你，嗯，原來是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "的確是出人意料，一個雷姆必拓人，一個從一開始就悄悄蟄伏在尚蜀的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可聽不懂啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿燈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什——！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "套索？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你把這些眠獸訓練得不錯，如果是尋常人，此刻就該倒栽蔥紮在地裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不僅能立刻發現背後的陷阱，還能穩穩把繩索踩在腳下......這老頭......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別擔心，我不難為你一個姑娘家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道你懷裡的那隻酒盞，是什麼東西嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不關心，也不在乎。問太多的賞金獵人，都是新手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就要怪你自己了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別這麼得意！小帽！鑽頭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然不知道是什麼，就老老實實把東西交出來，不要白白遭人利用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你竟然對小帽——！你自找的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......無頭箭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（用、用手抓住了？這個距離！？我可是才給弩換過弦的——！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "念在你不願意傷人性命的份上，我給你一個機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把這酒盞給我，然後告訴你背後的人：慎行，忌私。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，你知道我背後是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知不知道不重要，重要的是，我能在這條路上堵住你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我憑什麼聽你的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你沒得選。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你自己也許逃得掉，但你總不忍心看見，自己飼養的這些小畜生遭了殃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你威脅我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你有些身手，可除了擺弄弓弩，也沒啥功夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大可不必敬酒不吃吃罰酒，混江湖，是要靠眼力識人的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......確實，那個人也沒和我說，會有你這樣的高手來礙事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我拜託一個人去做一件危險的事，那我也多半不會全盤托出的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "外鄉人，一份工作而已，何必搭上身家性命？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把盞給我，我以鏢局的名義擔保，那人許你多少錢財，我們雙倍奉上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哈，本來就是虧本買賣，義務勞動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算是幫朋友忙吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來你這樣的荒野流寇，也願意為朋友兩肋插刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好像對我們有點意見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沒有的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "生意做久了，貴人多了，朋友也就少了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你就老老實實回去做生意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，山上的生意是最好做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這三山十七峰幾百條山道，哪條道上沒有供人歇腳休憩的茶館驛站，哪條道上......沒有我們的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "望姑娘知曉輕重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還真不把我放在眼裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然正面開戰不是我的風格，但是都被挑釁到這個份上了......對吧，小傢伙們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（雷姆必拓語）讓這個老傢伙知道厲害！我們摸爬滾打這麼多年，也不是吃乾飯的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "執迷不悟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "若是如此，那就得罪——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哪怕有第三個人站在一旁，他也絕對看不清這一步，是怎麼踏上前來的。\n只因為這個人擅長走路，擅長爬山。他每天抬步踏步的次數，實在是太多太多。\n一聲脆響，地上，青磚碎裂，身前，煙塵濛濛，眼旁，是一根樸素無奇的竹木扁擔，微微發青。\n遠方，又一聲擊鑼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——怎、怎麼......這個人是從哪裡......啊，阿燈，別怕，鑽頭！快到我這裡......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你終於上山了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我來找你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該來的總要來。躲是躲不完的。你又何必這麼著急？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，小女娃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......叫我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（他的動作——這根木條是叫扁擔來著？他剛才做了什麼......把石磚地拍得粉碎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你認得他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就是你們之間有什麼麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們之間只站著你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說的對，那我就是你的麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事辦完了，我會去找你。但不是現在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......小女娃，和你手裡護著的玩意，有關係？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啊......是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你我私仇，別扯上這件大事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多大的事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "百姓安危，士卒存亡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......自從那年雨夜之後，我很少聽你有這樣的語氣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊。你怎麼會是個惡人呢。一個俠義心腸的刀客，一個本分做人的掌櫃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你就讓開——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——可我正知道你是這樣一個人，所以你不來見我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不見我，我去找你，也沒有結果。所以我也沒有下過山。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那如果......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啊！你——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還給我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......十年了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "十年前，你就是為了護這隻酒盞......看著我兒子死於非命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......尚塚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小女娃，這沒你什麼事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你趁我不注意搶了我的貨，還敢說沒我事了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這貨本來也不是你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尚塚，你昏頭了嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒你什麼事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尚塚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "滾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嘁！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們最好記住......我一定會把東西搶回來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......鄭清鉞。你的刀呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在家裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦。在家裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那年雨夜，走鏢路上，共犧牲了十幾號人。其中有一個兒子，一個父親。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兒子姓尚，是我的兒子。父親姓杜，是杜遙夜的親爹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你就不戴刀了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天大的笑話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你恨我到現在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不恨你，我知道你不是故意的，責任在你，錯不在你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“先救貨，再救人”，哼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可貨沒了，人也沒了，難道還不許我怨你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我必須向你討個說法，否則我活不下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我答應你。酒盞給我。你知道，這隻酒盞牽扯——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道。當年他為這隻酒盞而死，今天，我要拿這隻酒盞給他陪葬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在山上等你，等你去取刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g01_yanstreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......慎師傅！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？你們怎麼先來了？我剛打算去梁府找你們呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鯉小子呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那隻酒盞被偷了，鯉先生讓我們來找您來著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他有交代過什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他讓你們來找我，卻沒讓你們先去找那梁大人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們分明是從梁府出來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唉。沒讓你們找梁洵，說明他心底裡已經知道了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人精，人精，確實是人精。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g04_yaninn"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太合叔，回來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以她身份而言，禮數周到，名副其實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "願意演這番禮數周到，說明還有斡旋餘地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不論她本人做何動作，有何居心。太傅手諭在此，作不得假。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她是個聰明人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我既以官身拜訪，她當有所覺察。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如今兩方都如勁弓滿弦，一觸即發。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唯有在惹出更多口舌非議之前，了結事端。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果真的要讓所有人相信，我們的選擇能讓大炎永除後患，那我們自然得依那四個字——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——光明磊落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
